{"route":"/karnal/services-modern-interior-design","city":"karnal","nested":false,"meta":{"og":{"type":"website","site_name":"9th-Corner","title":"Modern Interior Design in Karnal | 9th Corner","description":"Modern interior design in Karnal by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.","url":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-modern-interior-design","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg","image:width":"1200","image:height":"630"},"twitter":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Modern Interior Design in Karnal | 9th Corner","description":"Modern interior design in Karnal by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.","image":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/og-default.jpg"},"title":"Modern Interior Design in Karnal | 9th Corner","robots":"index, follow","author":"9th-Corner","publisher":"9th-Corner","google-site-verification":"bFDxjFr1uDW3hEQ7YEzagKY9ZLzkrW1k1vtMcyQahyE","description":"Modern interior design in Karnal by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.","keywords":"Modern Interior Design in Karnal, Best modern interior designers in Karnal, Contemporary interior designers in Karnal, Affordable modern interior design in Karnal, Minimalistic interior design in Karnal, Modern home interior designers in Karnal, Modern 2BHK interior design Karnal, Modern 3BHK interior design Karnal, Luxury modern interior design Karnal, Modern apartment interior designers in Karnal, Modern commercial interior designers in Karnal, Modern office interior design in Karnal, Modern modular kitchen designs in Karnal, Modern living room interior design Karnal, Contemporary home decor Karnal, Modern interior decorators in Karnal, Turnkey modern interior design services in Karnal,","theme-color":"#0f141f","canonical":"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-modern-interior-design"},"jsonLd":["{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":[\"Ninth Corner\",\"9th-Corner\"],\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"image\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"logo\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/img/logo.avif\",\"description\":\"Modern interior design is all about simplicity, elegance, and functionality. At our firm, we specialize in creating contemporary spaces in Karnal that are stylish, comfortable, and tailored to your lifestyle. Our modern interiors blend clean lines\",\"telephone\":\"+91-9310582834\",\"email\":\"ninthcorner83@gmail.com\",\"priceRange\":\"$$$\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Pearls Best Heights I, 808, Netaji Subhash Place, Pitampura\",\"addressLocality\":\"Delhi\",\"postalCode\":\"110034\",\"addressRegion\":\"Delhi\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"City\",\"name\":\"Karnal\"},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.facebook.com/ninthcornerINC\",\"https://www.instagram.com/9thcorner.interiors/\",\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/9th-corner-int/\",\"https://youtube.com/@9thcorner\"]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Karnal\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Modern Interior Design in Karnal\",\"item\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-modern-interior-design\"}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#website\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":\"Ninth Corner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is modern interior design for a home in Karnal?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Clean lines, open layouts, a calm colour palette and practical furniture. It suits new independent houses that want a fresh, uncluttered look.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can modern design suit a joint family home?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Modern layouts can include more storage, flexible seating and separate private areas, so they work well for large families.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is a modern home more expensive to build?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Not necessarily. Simple forms and fewer decorative details can even reduce cost. The budget depends mostly on materials and fittings.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How long does modern interior design last before it looks dated?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Because it relies on simple forms and good materials rather than trends, a well-done modern interior stays fresh for many years.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Modern Interior Design in Karnal, Haryana\",\"serviceType\":\"Modern Interior Design\",\"description\":\"Modern interior design in Karnal by 9th Corner: clean lines, smart storage and calm colours for homes and offices that feel open and bright.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/karnal/services-modern-interior-design\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Karnal, Haryana\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/e2.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Modern Interior Design in Karnal, Haryana</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Modern Homes for a Changing Karnal</h2>\n            <p>Our modern interior design services in Karnal focus on the intersection of simplicity and luxury. We specialize in crafting environments defined by clean lines, neutral sophisticated palettes, and contemporary furniture. Our goal is to create spaces that breathe—feeling organized, spacious, and visually serene.</p>\n            <p>Younger Karnal families, and those returning from Delhi, Chandigarh or abroad, want lighter, more practical homes than the heavily decorated houses they grew up in. Modern interior design gives them clean lines, good storage, plenty of light and furniture that is easy to live with, without losing the warmth of a family home.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Balancing Style with Practicality</h2>\n            <p>\"We design residential and commercial spaces that merge avant-garde aesthetics with daily utility. Every element—from open-plan layouts to recessed architectural lighting—is curated to create a cohesive, modern environment tailored specifically to the North Indian lifestyle.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Modern Kothis</h3>\n                <p>In large Karnal homes, a modern approach means one open family area, a sleek kitchen with an island, built-in wardrobes instead of separate almirahs and bathrooms with frameless glass and wall-hung fittings. Big windows bring in light, while a few rich materials keep the space warm.</p><p>A modern puja room can still feel sacred, with stone, wood and soft light.</p><p>Outdoor lawns and car porches follow the same clean lines, with simple planters and wall lights.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Apartments and Smaller Homes</h3>\n                <p>In flats in the newer residential projects, modern interior design helps rooms feel larger. Light colours, slim furniture, sliding doors and wall-mounted storage free up floor space, while mirrors and good lighting add depth.</p><p>Bunk beds, fold-down desks and tall wardrobes help small bedrooms work hard.</p><p>Dining tables with built-in benches seat more people in less space.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Warmth in a Modern Home</h3>\n                <p>Modern does not have to mean cold. We use wood, textured fabrics, rugs and warm lighting to make rooms inviting, especially in Karnal's long winters. Matte finishes hide dust and fingerprints. Hidden storage keeps surfaces clear, while a few personal items, family photos or art, keep the home personal.</p><p>A modern look does not need costly imports. Good proportions, tidy storage and the right lighting matter more than brand names.</p><p>Cold floors are a winter complaint, so we suggest rugs, wooden flooring in bedrooms or warm tiles where the budget allows.</p><p><b>Minimalist Mastery:</b> Creating high-impact layouts using a 'less is more' approach, emphasizing quality materials over clutter to achieve a feeling of calm luxury.</p><p><b>Material Innovation:</b> Integrating industrial and natural elements—metal, glass, and raw wood—to provide texture and depth to modern, monochromatic schemes.</p><p><b>Ergonomic Flow:</b> Modern interior design that supports natural human movement, ensuring that beauty never compromises the comfort of your living or work experience.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Creating Your Modern Home</h3>\n                <p>We like to start with pictures. Share a few images of homes you admire, and we will visit your house in Karnal to see what is possible. Our modern interior design proposal then comes back as a plan, a short list of finishes and 3D views of the main rooms.</p><p>Local craftsmen build to our drawings, our supervisor watches the details daily, and every edge is checked before handover.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Modern Interior Design With Karnal Warmth</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>Clean, simple spaces demand precise work. We supervise closely so the final finish matches the design. Hinges, edges and gaps are checked on every cabinet before handover.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Specialists in International Contemporary Design Principles</strong>\n                    Current, international design ideas.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Customized Solutions for Luxury Homes and Corporate Hubs</strong>\n                    Modern solutions for luxury homes and offices.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Seamless End-to-End Project Handling and On-Site Management</strong>\n                    Smooth project handling with on-site management.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Cosy in Winter</strong>\n                    Warm materials and lighting for foggy months.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Easy to Maintain</strong>\n                    Low-sheen finishes that do not show dust.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Ready to embrace the modern standard? Partner with Karnal’s premier contemporary designers today.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects in Haryana</h2>\n                <p>Homes from our portfolio in Bhiwani and Sonipat.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/mr-vijay-singh-sonipat/509.avif\" alt=\"Home interior in Sonipat, Haryana by 9th Corner\" title=\"Sonipat Home Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/mr-umesh-jain-bhivani/72.avif\" alt=\"House interior in Bhiwani, Haryana by 9th Corner\" title=\"Bhiwani House Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class