oading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/mr-virend-singh-gurgaon/1.avif\" alt=\"House in Gurgaon, Haryana by 9th Corner\" title=\"Gurgaon House\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What is modern interior design for a home in Karnal?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Clean lines, open layouts, a calm colour palette and practical furniture. It suits new independent houses that want a fresh, uncluttered look.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can modern design suit a joint family home?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Modern layouts can include more storage, flexible seating and separate private areas, so they work well for large families.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Is a modern home more expensive to build?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Not necessarily. Simple forms and fewer decorative details can even reduce cost. The budget depends mostly on materials and fittings.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">How long does modern interior design last before it looks dated?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Because it relies on simple forms and good materials rather than trends, a well-done modern interior stays fresh for many years.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>A Lighter, Simpler Home</h2>\n            <p>A well-designed modern home makes daily life easier and feels fresh for years. Modern interior design, done with care, brings that to Karnal families.</p><p>Thinking of a modern home in Karnal? <a href=\"/karnal/contact\">Write to 9th Corner</a>.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}